00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:14.080
<v Matt Young>very deep point solution. I'd like to think that we're the best in the business when it comes

302
00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:20.520
<v Matt Young>to product feedback, but not surprisingly, you need other systems in place to get the most use

303
00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:25.840
<v Matt Young>UserVoice. And having as a buyer to go to a bunch of different companies and buy those

