00:23:30.320 --> 00:23:35.100
<v Matt Young>solutions that make up a holistic suite of software that customer facing teams would use,

306
00:23:35.300 --> 00:23:40.520
<v Matt Young>that people doing research in an organization would use. So either through partnerships or

